<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Most new <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> files can be used without being included in this 2da, however new <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2da" title="M2da (page does not exist)">m2da</a> files must be defined in an m2da fragment which extends the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a>.
</p>
